        Conducting monetary policy and monitoring economic developments,3,3,"This section reviews the Federal Reserve's monetary policy and economic developments in 2023, including the Federal Reserve's efforts to maintain price stability and promote maximum employment. It includes summaries of the March 2024 and June 2023 Monetary Policy Reports to Congress.",March 2024 Summary,0,0002
        Promoting financial system stability,3,3,"This section discusses the Federal Reserve's activities and research aimed at fostering a resilient and stable financial system, including monitoring financial vulnerabilities and domestic and international cooperation.",March 2024 Summary,0,0003
        Supervising and regulating financial institutions and their activities,3,3,"This section summarizes the Federal Reserve's efforts in supervising and regulating financial institutions, including oversight and examinations, supervisory policymaking, and regulatory activities and enforcement.",March 2024 Summary,0,0004
        Fostering payment and settlement system safety and efficiency,3,3,"This section describes the Federal Reserve's actions to promote the effectiveness of the nation's payment systems, including initiatives to enhance payment system safety and data on Reserve Bank services and income.",March 2024 Summary,0,0005
