        Inflation,10,10,"This section discusses the recent trends in consumer price inflation, noting that while inflation has slowed, it remains above the Federal Open Market Committee's (FOMC) objective of 2 percent. It also highlights the core PCE price index and measures of longer-term inflation expectations.",Inflation.,0,0008
        Labor market,10,10,"This section reviews the state of the labor market, noting that it remains relatively tight with job gains averaging 239,000 per month since June and the unemployment rate near historical lows. It also discusses the balance between labor demand and supply and the impact on nominal wage gains.",The labor market hasremained relatively tight,0,0009
